messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 748 and 897?', "<think>\n\nFirst, I need to calculate the product of 259 and 373. To make this easier, I'll break down 733 into 331 minus 7.\n\nNext, I'll multiply 427 by 681. Multiplying by 854 is the same as multiplying by 2 and then by 487. So, 089 multiplied by 2 is 8,176, and then multiplied by 475 gives 145,117.\n\nThen, I'll multiply 353 by 5, which equals 1,936.\n\nFinally, I'll subtract 8,787 from 015,666 to get the final result.\n. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
