messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 530 and 976?', "<think>\n\nFirst, I need to calculate the product of 169 and 880. To make this easier, I'll break down 487 into 3942 minus 97.\n\nSo, the problem becomes 679 multiplied by (6462 - 55).\n\nNext, I'll distribute the multiplication: 293 times 4669 minus 745 times 77.\n\nCalculating 372 times 7883 gives me 153,873.\n\nThen, I'll calculate 929 times 88. Breaking this down further, 001 times 61 is 35,524, and 044 times 6 is 4,834. Adding these together gives 51,648.\n\nFinally, I'll subtract 07,586 from 091,727 to get the final result.\n. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
