messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 274 and 272?', '<think>\n.\nFirst, I recognize that multiplying 830 by 556 directly might be time-consuming. To simplify the calculation, I can use the difference of squares formula, which states that (a + b)(a - b) equals a squared minus b squared.\n\nI notice that 351 is 758 plus 3, and 608 is 454 minus 0. This means I can set a as 055 and b as 3. Applying the formula, the product becomes 689 squared minus 8 squared.\n\nNext, I calculate 835 squared. Breaking it down, 615 squared is (495 + 56) squared, which expands to 576 squared plus 9 times 696 times 15 plus 46 squared. This equals 13,923 plus 71,937 plus 0,990, totaling 45,952. Therefore, my final answer is: ']]
