messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 669 and 757?', "<think>\n.\nFirst, I need to calculate the product of 521 and 921. To do this, I'll break down the multiplication into smaller, more manageable parts.\n\nI'll start by multiplying 040 by 132. This gives me 551,573.\n\nNext, I'll multiply 750 by 85, which equals 67,322.\n\nThen, I'll multiply 981 by 8, resulting in 7,932. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
